# ELSTER developer materials: the ERiC licence agreement and the data-protection
# sheet it obliges us to show end users. Kept locally, never committed — § 14 of the
# agreement binds us to confidentiality, the documents come from an account-gated
# developer area, and the personal remote is a public repository. Both spellings are
# listed because the directory was renamed; keeping the old one costs nothing.
elster/
elster_eric/

# Public official forms and instructions. Keep the downloaded files locally with
# provenance; only reviewed/normalized material is promoted into KB/ or application
# form assets.
official_sources/forms/

# Local working material: kept out of git by request. official_sources/ holds
# downloaded official form PDFs and their notes; MCP_SOURCE_SYNC_RESEARCH.md is a
# local scratch document.
official_sources/
docs/MCP_SOURCE_SYNC_RESEARCH.md

# The working agreement Claude Code reads at the start of a session. Local by
# request: it is instructions to a tool, not part of the product.
CLAUDE.md

# Slide-deck build output. presentation/ is regenerated from its sources by the
# pptx tooling; .codex-finalizer/ and .chart-data-* are that tooling's scratch
# directories - candidate decks, inspection dumps and chart snapshots.
presentation/
.codex-finalizer/
.chart-data-*/
